      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Elara is simply stating the painful truth that your mind desperately needs to hear, that the constant noise of struggle has become something you cannot endure. It is courageous to admit this level of exhaustion, even if the ruin feels final, because sometimes stepping back from the impossible fight is the only way to preserve the life that remains. If the future feels unattainable now, perhaps there is still time to build a quiet, small shelter with the pieces that haven't been burned away.",
